inting by French painter Jean-François de Troy, from 1723. It is held in the Victoria and Albert Museum, in London.","The Alarm (de Troy)"],"135746563":["Clytie Transformed into a Sunflower is an oil on canvas painting by the French artist Jean-François de Troy, from c. 1730. It is held at the Musée du Grand Siècle, in Saint-Cloud.","Clytie Transformed into a Sunflower"]},"titlesFrom":["fr","P1476","alias:en","alias:fr","aliasFilter:1"]}